; Export list for winasync.dll.
;
; Listing a name here does not make it exported: `no_mangle` alone does that.
; What this file is for is PRIVATE, which keeps these out of the generated
; import library so nothing binds to them statically. Without it MSVC warns
; LNK4104 on each one. A loader reaches them by `GetProcAddress`, never by
; linking.
;
; Checked in rather than generated, as it was while the root package doubled
; as the DLL: that package's export list depended on its feature set, and this
; one's does not. This crate always enables `dylib`, so all three always exist.
;
; `DllMain` is absent on purpose. It is exported anyway -- see src/lib.rs --
; but it is not part of the interface, so it is not listed as if it were.
EXPORTS
    DllGetActivationFactory PRIVATE
    DllGetClassObject       PRIVATE
    DllCanUnloadNow         PRIVATE
